WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.710
Both characters jump into air-to-air range.

2
00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.150
Jumping medium punch catches Juri in the air.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.800
Chun-Li activates airborne Level 1 after the medium punch.

4
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.450
